    "storage": {
      "value": "<p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"excerpt\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"717278dc-718b-49c8-a7cd-dfd39bc2850f\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"atlassian-macro-output-type\">INLINE</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"status\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"82d85492-5433-49ee-8dbb-bfc65c7849b4\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"colour\">Red</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">fail</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"\" /></ac:structured-macro></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><br /></p><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"toc\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"5614d8d2-d0ff-4a5f-b90f-38432e58c650\" /></p><h2>Research and Context</h2><p>HyprMX is a company with  in-app ads from premium advertisers e.g. BMW, Emirates. We believe they can offer premium CPMs for inventory and, unlike AppLovin will not affect the user experience.</p><h2>Hypothesis</h2><p>If we implement ineterstitials from HyprMX into our apps, we'll earn extra $200/day thanks to additional premium demand.</p><h2>Project Owner and Team Member(s)</h2><p class=\"confluence-link\"><strong>Owner</strong>:<strong> </strong><strong><ac:link><ri:user ri:userkey=\"08730d2a55a7e89d01570f40d61c0004\" /></ac:link> </strong></p><p class=\"confluence-link\"><strong>Team</strong>: <ac:link><ri:user ri:userkey=\"308924de793bc28701795b17bef70002\" /></ac:link> </p><h2>Description of the Solution &amp; Mockups</h2><h3>Solution</h3><p>We'll implement HyprMX adapter to Google</p><p>iOS documentation: <a href=\"https://documentation.hyprmx.com/ios-hyprmx-sdk/3rd-party-mediation/hyprmx-mobile-sdk-admob-adapter-overview\">https://documentation.hyprmx.com/ios-hyprmx-sdk/3rd-party-mediation/hyprmx-mobile-sdk-admob-adapter-overview</a></p><p>Android documentation: <a href=\"https://documentation.hyprmx.com/android-sdk/3rd-party-mediation/hyprmx-mobile-sdk-admob-adapter-overview\">https://documentation.hyprmx.com/android-sdk/3rd-party-mediation/hyprmx-mobile-sdk-admob-adapter-overview</a></p><table class=\"wrapped\"><colgroup><col /></colgroup><tbody><tr><th scope=\"col\">Parameters</th></tr><tr><td>To be added</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><table class=\"wrapped\"><colgroup><col /></colgroup><tbody><tr><th scope=\"col\">How HyprMX interstitials look</th></tr><tr><td>To be added</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Execution</h2><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"jira\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"0af8c7a0-80ed-4a1b-bd01-006cd7398064\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"server\">Jira</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"columnIds\">issuekey,summary,issuetype,duedate,assignee,status</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"columns\">key,summary,type,due,assignee,status</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"maximumIssues\">20</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"jqlQuery\">project = AD AND issuekey = AD-300 OR (&quot;Epic Link&quot; = AD-300 or parent in (AD-300))                </ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"serverId\">d1985a03-3c98-365b-8107-f4cdc34a26f1</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro></p><h2>Results</h2><p>Не удалось интегрировать через GAM.</p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p>",
